graph TD
    A[Start: Select Building] --> B[Get Building Geometry & Attributes]
    B --> C[Determine Analysis Time (Hour & Season)]
    C --> D[Calculate Solar Position (Altitude & Azimuth)]
    D --> E{Sun Altitude >= 5°?}
    E -- No --> F[Mark Hour as No Sun]
    E -- Yes --> G[Query Neighboring Buildings within 200m]
    G --> H[For Each Neighbor: Calculate Shadow Polygon]
    H --> I[Union All Shadow Polygons]
    I --> J[Intersect with Rooftop Polygon]
    J --> K[Calculate Shadow Fraction]
    K --> L[Sunlit Percentage = 1 - Shadow Fraction]
    L --> M{Sunlit % > 30%?}
    M -- No --> N[Mark Hour as Not Sunny]
    M -- Yes --> O[Mark Hour as Sunny]
    N --> P[Next Hour]
    O --> P
    P --> Q{All Hours Processed?}
    Q -- No --> C
    Q -- Yes --> R[Compute Sunny Hours & Average Sunlit %]
    R --> S[Calculate Final Score]
    S --> T[Output: Score, Financials, etc.]
